A comment-only paragraph loosens a list as a comment line does

````
- x

  {% a z %}
```
.
<ul>
  <li>x</li>
</ul>
<pre><code></code></pre>
````

```
- x

  {% a
   z %}
::: x
.
<ul>
  <li>x</li>
</ul>
<div class="x">

</div>
```

```
- a
  - x

    {% a z %}
- s
.
<ul>
  <li><p>a</p>
    <ul>
      <li>x</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><p>s</p></li>
</ul>
```
